| results/sample_pca_scores.csv | table | Sample ID, condition and first two PCA coordinates |

## Execution
Runs: batch
Expected runtime: under 10 minutes; expected outputs: one PNG figure and one small CSV table. Uses the workspace's configured batch executor and the `gars-bio` environment.
